      "text": "Being filled with … maliciousness, Rom. 1:29. keep the feast … neither with the leaven of malice, 1 Cor. 5:8. in malice be ye children, but in understanding be men, 1 Cor. 14:20. Let all bitterness … be put away from you, with all malice, Eph. 4:31. put off all these; anger, wrath, malice, Col. 3:8. we ourselves also were … living in malice, Titus 3:3. laying aside all malice, 1 Pet. 2:1. not using your liberty for a cloak of maliciousness, 1 Pet. 2:16.",
